      <activity id="37ba9454-ae09-56de-8fc7-b1fb6ba4284c" activityNameId="560550aa-6370-5217-9927-c94d84a55229" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Door frame, inner, wood, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Door frame, inner, wood, at plant
Data are based on a door leaf of 0.9m x 2m and scaled to 1m2 door. 1m2 of wooden door frame weighs 8kg. The bill of materials is based on data from door manufactures.;
UUID: 7f32400a-22ab-3987-aa30-3d5c62244a43
Included are the materials used in an inner wooden door frame (without surface treatment). Production losses and the transport of the materials are also included.
Location: Data apply to the supply in Switzerland.
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data survey at 4 door manufactures in Switzerland. 
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_7f32400a-22ab-3987-aa30-3d5c62244a43.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
